id=\"faq-question-1657950248901\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">2. <strong>Who is SEO Specialist?<\/strong> <\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">An SEO Specialist is an experienced person in the team who works on creating new strategies or revamping the existing SEO strategies for better results.\u00a0<br\/><br\/><strong>The role of an SEO Specialist or Expert includes:<br\/><\/strong>a. Crafting strategy for search engine optimization for driving traffic and improving keyword rankings<br\/>b. Coordinating with PPC team for well-execution of ad campaigns<br\/>c. Managing SEO budget, providing an estimated monthly budget for projects, and working accordingly<br\/>d. Collaborating with SEO Executives, content writers, and web developers for executing the project<br\/>e. Have skills in search engine marketing (SEM)<br\/>f. Creating backlink building strategies according to projects <br\/> <\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1657950348868\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">3. <strong>Who is SEO Manager?<\/strong> <\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">As the name suggests, SEO Manager is in charge of the projects and SEO team. It is a managerial role that demands not only high experience in the field, but also the ability to manage a team and multiple projects simultaneously.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1657950383347\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">4. <strong>How to learn SEO online?<\/strong> <\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">You can learn SEO skills with reliable resources like the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">online SEO course by WsCube Tech<\/a>.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1657950419120\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">5. <strong>What are some SEO interview questions for 4 years experience?<\/strong> <\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Below is 